Hi Ista,

Thank you very much, I like your workaround :)
So if someone else has this problem, here is the code to make it look
like stat_smooth:

require(arm)
require(ggplot2)

x <- c(1,1,2,2)
y <- c(1,2,3,4)

mod <- lm(y ~ x)
se <- se.coef(mod)
pred <-  predict(mod)

dat <- data.frame(x,y, pred)

p <- ggplot(dat,aes(x,y)) + geom_point() +

geom_ribbon(alpha=0.2,aes(x=x,ymin=pred+se[2],ymax=pred-se[2])) +
geom_line(colour=4,aes(x=x, y=pred))

Best wishes,
Simon

