From u0c39e60ddb38622b at groups.google.com  Sat Jul 31 17:48:51 2010
From: u0c39e60ddb38622b at groups.google.com (Dennis Murphy)
Date: Sat, 31 Jul 2010 17:48:51 +0000
Subject: Re: How to reduce the font size of tick marks and rotate them?
Message-ID: <JdEzCrs_oyc.rgL4CskvMdkJ@ggplot2.groups.google.com>
In-Reply-To: <JdEzCrs_oyc.oxvzZptaFEgJ@ggplot2.groups.google.com>
References: <JdEzCrs_oyc.sMIKbpVgtKwJ@ggplot2.groups.google.com> <JdEzCrs_oyc.oxvzZptaFEgJ@ggplot2.groups.google.com>
Archived-At: <https://groups.google.com/g/ggplot2/c/JdEzCrs_oyc/m/rgL4CskvMdkJ>
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset="utf-8"
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

g <- ggplot(mpg, aes(x = displ, y = hwy))
g + geom_point() + opts(axis.text.x = theme_text(angle = 90),
                         axis.title.x = theme_text(angle = 90),
                         axis.title.y = theme_text(angle = 0))

HTH,
Dennis

