MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset="utf-8"
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Just use the + opts() like you do in ggplot().

library(ggplot2)
head(mpg)
png('main.png')

qplot(displ,hwy,data=mpg) + opts(axis.text.x = theme_text(angle = 90), axis.title.x = theme_text(angle = 90), axis.title.y = theme_text(angle = 0))
dev.off()

Works like a charm.

Brandon

